    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled right on Main Street in the picturesque village of Glin, this charming 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom mid-terraced house offers the perfect blend of village convenience and modern comfort.  The bright and inviting downstairs accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a cozy sitting room perfect for relaxing, a fully equipped kitchen, and a convenient modern shower room. Upstairs, you will find three generous-sized bedrooms, including a master bedroom with its own private ensuite. The property has the benefit of all mains connections, oil-fired central heating, composite front door, and double-glazed uPVC windows. One of the standout features of this home is its exceptional outdoor space. The property enjoys secure off-street parking with a gated entrance to the rear, leading into a spacious, low-maintenance split level concrete courtyard that acts as a genuine sun trap on summer days. Additionally, a selection of lockup stores to the rear provides incredible versatility, ideal for workshops, home gyms, or extensive outdoor storage. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a home ready for immediate occupation in a vibrant, scenic community.  Contact Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers on 068 21739 to arrange a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.5m x 1.2m \r\nVinyl flooring, composite front door. \r\n\r\nSitting room - 4.8m x 4.6m \r\nFitted carpet, large window overlooking main street, solid fuel open fire place with granite hearth and insert. \r\n\r\nInternal corridor - 4.7m x 0.9m \r\nVinyl flooring and staircase to first floor.  \r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.9m x 3.9m \r\nVinyl flooring, fully fitted kitchen with electric oven, hob and overhead extractor, stainless steel sink, plumbed for washing machine and rear door access to fully enclosed rear courtyard. \r\n\r\nCloakroom - 1.9m x 1.3m \r\nVinyl flooring, built in hotpress with new how water tank installed in 2024 and ATC water heater for instant hot water.  \r\n\r\nDownstairs Shower Room - 2.2m x 1.8m \r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, wc, whb, pump shower and frosted window.  \r\n\r\nLanding - 2.9m x 1.8m \r\nFitted carpet, attic access, built in storage. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Master Ensuite) - 5.8m x 3.9m \r\nFitted carpet, overlooking rear courtyard.\n\nEnsuite - wc, whb, pump shower, resin floor. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.4m x 2.7m \r\nFitted carpet, built in floor to ceiling wardrobes, overlooking Main Street.  \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.7m x 3.1m \r\nFitted carpet, overlooking Main Street, built in floor to ceiling wardrobes. \r\n\r\nLock up store 1 - 3.3m x 2.5m \r\nBlock built lock up store/utility with concrete floor and vinyl floor covering, electricity, plumbed for appliances and oil boiler. \r\n\r\nLock up store 2 - 4.5m x 2.7m \r\nBlock built lean to with galvanized steel roof, concrete floor and oil tank. \r\n\r\nLock up store 3 - 2.9m x 2.7m \r\nBlock built lean to with galvanized steel roof and concrete floor.  \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Heritage village Location - walk to all amenities.\r\nStone construction with a flat roof, block built 2 storey extension to the rear.  House has been reconfigured over the years. \r\nMains water and sewer.\r\nBeautiful coastal walks, sea swimming, primary school and playground all on your doorstep.  \r\nTarbert Car Ferry is 10km from Glin connecting you to Killimer and the greater Clare area.  \r\nLimerick City - 51km, Listowel - 25km, Ballybunion - 31km, Newcastlewest 23km, Adare - 41km. \r\nThe Adare Bypass Phase when completed, will offer even greater connectivity to Adare and beyond. \r\nViewings are highly advised for this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E1"
      }
